	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040060"},
		line=872,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A raven's caw greets me as I ascend the steps to the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I turn to find close to twenty such grim and ghastly birds perched atop the palace walls.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The fowls' fiery eyes blaze with anticipation, as though hungrily awaiting the spilling of blood at a scaffold.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Get thee hence, blackbirds. You'll find no sustenance here.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"As though comprehending mine words, the birds scatter at once.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The sight of ravens is said to be an ill portent, but there is nothing which threatens to darken the skies over\nHimi-no-Mikoto's reign.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"All should yet be well.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, got a minute?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Later that afternoon, Tooru comes to pay me a visit.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I've got a favor to ask of you.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Another criminal on the loose?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Even more important than that, old chap.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“You see...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Tooru meets mine gaze with a rarely-seen intensity.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I would like to arrange a marriage interview with Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"That's the last thing I would have imagined.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Is that really so strange?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You can say that again. Do you not already have a wife and child?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Well... feelings can change, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“After thinking it over, I realized that I will have none other besides Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Her fair features, her dignified voice, and above all else, that inviolable grace!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Is there any other of her stature in all the realm?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Having had the fortune to lay eyes upon her, I've come to realize now that I must make her mine.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, I would go as far as to call it my destiny.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"He passionately lays bare all his feelings.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"But still, to abandon his family...",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Have you yet to sober from last night? You're acting unlike your usual self.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Anyone can change. Especially out of love.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“As soon as you awaken to such passions, you'll find yourself to be the same man no longer.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Tooru's words contain not a single trace of jest.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"...Is love truly capable of changing a man so?",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Perhaps this is an occasion I ought to hold mine tongue, lest Tooru tell me off once again for mine “uncouth” ignorance of human emotions.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I do not make this request lightly.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, would you serve as a liaison between me and Himi-no-Mikoto?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I cannot.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I know nothing of the subtleties of the human heart.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"On top of which, Himi-no-Mikoto is easily stirred to emotion whenever the subject of her marriage comes up.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I have no confidence in mine ability to convey Tooru's intentions.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Never again will Inou Tooru ask anything of you! Please, I beg!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Please, Mitsurugi! Make a man of me!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"He forcefully lowers his head to me.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Ahh... I cannot possibly spurn such an earnest request from Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Plus, I can be assured that he is a man of exceptional character.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But you know how bad I am with words. Do not expect too much out of me.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Could you arrange a private meeting between me and Himi-no-Mikoto-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Marriage interviews have their own decorum to be upheld. I am powerless to change that.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Right... Sorry for asking the impossible.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No, I should be the one to apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“It would be more than enough if you'd put in a good word for me to Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Please. Consider it a favor to an old friend.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Yeah, I got it. You can count on me.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I find Himi-no-Mikoto as she makes preparations to go on an outing.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I've been looking for you. Where might you have been?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Attend me. We go to that hill.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Once again, she wants to go to our usual spot.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Before that, I have a matter to discuss.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“It's about Inou Tooru.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What is it? Make it brief.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Inou Tooru says he wishes to arrange a marriage interview with you.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Huh? Is that man not trothed to another?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He says he changed his conscience upon awakening to his love for you.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Does he intend to dissolve his current union? How ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto heaves a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Um... Tooru is a good man.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Though he is easily flattered and wont to drink, he is also most quick-witted and good-natured.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“His men trust him greatly, and he is beloved by the people. All this I can personally attest to.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What are you trying to say?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“In light of that, might you consider him for your groom?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You leave me at a loss for words.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"True to her declaration, Himi-no-Mikoto silently purses her lips for some time.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why do you insist on my taking a groom?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Sooner or later, you will have to do so.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If you leave no heir, the Empire you labored so tirelessly to build will swiftly crumble.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And if you are to choose a consort eventually, is it so wrong for me to at least elect someone worthy of you?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see you've become quite the adept casuist.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"She directs a cold glare in mine direction.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is furious, to say the least.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Beneath her nearly perfect mask of composure, I can sense the incandescent flames of her rage.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are hereby dismissed.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Until otherwise ordered, do not dare to show your face before me.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Her tone is one that brooks no rejoinder.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I merely kneel and bow mine head.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Only now do I realize that I've committed an irrevocable transgression.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Now that I've been dismissed, I no longer have anywhere to return to.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I didn't expect it to end well, but I never thought it would turn out this badly.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I suppose I deserve it for sticking mine nose where it\ndoesn't belong...”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I cast mine gaze upwards with a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ah, Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"As I wander about the streets, I come across Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You have quite the pallor about your complexion. Might some misfortune have befallen you?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You can tell?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, I am your attending priestess, am I not?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“When it comes to matters of Mitsurugi-sama, not the slightest irregularity could ever escape my notice!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I really can't get one past you, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hehehee, in which case, I shall also be doing this!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Chihaya takes mine arm into her own.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"The inscrutable reasoning of a young maiden still appears to be far beyond mine grasp.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I must head to the temple now, but what about...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I have no destination.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“In that case, I would certainly not object to an escort!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Without any reason to refuse, I decide to go along with her.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“By the way, Mitsurugi-sama, have you heard the news that Himi-no-Mikoto-sama will be retiring from her service in the priesthood?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No, I haven't.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Besides governing the Empire as its Empress, Himi-no-Mikoto also serves as its paramount priestess.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama is apparently preoccupied with matters of statecraft as of late, making it difficult for her to preside over rituals at the same time.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hence, she is establishing the role of Exalt-Priestess as someone who might administer the priesthood on her behalf.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Will rituals still succeed even if she is not there to perform them?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I believe we should be able to manage.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama has remade the system of magicks, such that even we ordinary priestesses can perform great rituals.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see. Then who is to be this Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Chihaya sheepishly points to herself.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Of all people, it is to be me...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is that not great cause for celebration?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“But there are many, many priestesses who hold precedence over me.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“And I am far from being the most distinguished in either ability or lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You know that Himi-no-Mikoto's word is law. If she decided it, then that's that.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Indeed, I am helpless but to accept this station.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Haah... I fear I'll be reduced to skin and bones with all the jealousy sure to come my way.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"She lets out a piteous sigh.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I wish there were any way I could help you.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Do you truly mean it?!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, how all my woes would disappear if only I had a─!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That I cannot help you with.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“A fate of skin and bones it is...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Chihaya hangs her head in dismay.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“At any rate, this is a role that Himi-no-Mikoto-sama has entrusted me with, so I shall give it absolutely everything I have.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I believe in you, Chihaya.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Incidentally, attending to you is to be a paramount duty of the Exalt-Priestess which will be passed down to all future successors.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Your existence is one that will endure for all eternity.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Even hundreds of years hence, the Exalt-Priestess will forever and always be 'Mitsurugi's bride,' serving as your humble handmaiden.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I know not the words to describe mine true sentiments, but you have mine sincere thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Just as humans require victuals for sustenance, so too does mine body require periodical infusions of spellforce.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"And as one who is undying, thus will I need to be replenished forevermore.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"It is most assuring to know that I will always have a source of magicks by mine side.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Thus will I be able to fully devote myself to mine purpose: cutting down all calamity befalling the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Though I must confess I am ever so slightly jealous of the fact that other priestesses besides me will eventually come to serve you...”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You are mine first bride. That ought to set you apart from all future Exalt-Priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh my, my! What a smooth talker you've become, Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Please keep that up and come to understand more and more about the human heart.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Chihaya shows me a delighted smile.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Now then, what might be the cause of the misfortune to have befallen you?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm? Oh, right...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I recommended a certain man to Himi-no-Mikoto for marriage, but...”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Say no more... She was terribly incensed, was she not?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'm impressed you could tell.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Absolutely anyone could tell!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You mustn't say such things, Mitsurugi-sama. How many times have we been over this already...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Chihaya wearily rubs her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“If you are to serve at Himi-no-Mikoto-sama's side, you must learn to understand a woman's heart.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am a mere tool of the battlefield. I know not the inner workings of a woman's heart.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“There you go, calling yourself a tool again.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You are free to think of yourself however you wish, but know that there are those of us who do not feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No matter what anyone says, I am and will always remain a tool.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“In that case, I invite you to try repeating what you just said to Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I daresay she will fly into a rage the likes of which will make her current disposition seem pleasant by comparison.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mh...”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Still, the Empire will be in jeopardy if Himi-no-Mikoto\ndoesn't soon birth an heir.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“She knows that better than anyone. Is that not why she is conducting marriage interviews?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“However, you are the very last person she wishes to hear that from.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Because a mere tool dares not presume to be so impudent?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Not at all! Oh, Mitsurugi-sama, you dimwit!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Chihaya puts her hands on her hips in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“This is another hypothetical example, but suppose I were to be taken with you...”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm? Does that mean you were making jest when you last told me you loved me?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, no more uncouth interruptions!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“S-Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...Ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hypothetically, now. Hypothetically, suppose I were to be taken with you...”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“If you then told me to offer my hand to another man, it is only natural that I would be most distraught.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“That is the essence of the human heart.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Now I understand why Himi-no-Mikoto is so angry.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Thank you for teaching me this important lesson, Chihaya.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine apologies, but I must beg your leave.”",
			},
